5,TRADITIONAL POMO: 'Hoy-Ya-A' (Shake Head Coming Out Song)Lecturer of American Indian Studies weaves traditional Pomo ...Culture | Coyote Valley Tribe,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsd6_2icQCg,"CURRENTS: Thunder Song, curated by composer and pianist Jerod Impichchaachaaha' Tate, celebrates the timeless art of American Indian storytelling and music. Nov 18, 2022 · Steward, who is a lecturer of American Indian Studies at San Francisco State University, listened to a variety of genres growing up on the Elem Indian Colony reservation: blues, rock, R&B, music of his Pomo tribe and more. In his latest album, “World Champion,” he skillfully blends these sounds. Experience the rich culture of the Coyote Valley Band of Pomo Indians through their vibrant language, traditional foods, and ceremonial dancing that honor ancestral heritage and strengthen community bonds.","Pomo, Eastern",Pomoan
6,Lecturer of American Indian Studies weaves traditional Pomo ...,https://news.sfsu.edu/news/lecturer-american-indian-studies-weaves-traditional-pomo-music-latest-album,"Nov 18, 2022 · Steward, who is a lecturer of American Indian Studies at San Francisco State University, listened to a variety of genres growing up on the Elem Indian Colony reservation: blues, rock, R&B, music of his Pomo tribe and more. In his latest album, “World Champion,” he skillfully blends these sounds.","Pomo, Eastern",Pomoan
